{{!
    @template format_aicourse/chatbox_icon

    One decorative study-tool icon for the AI Tutor. Exactly one of the flags is set; the icon is
    aria-hidden because the button it sits in carries the visible label.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isstructure, isconcepts, isworkplace, ispractice, ischecklist bool Which icon to draw.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "ispractice": true
    }
}}
